    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Game Series - Wasteland Horror Radio:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to WHR Sixty-Six Point, Uh.. Seven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Horror Radio is a new episodic horror game series by HsRetroGames made with Unreal Engine. Each game is a new episode, a new creepy tale or story of horror..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.poster.avif?t=1755525394\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.webm?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.mp4?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our near post apocalyptic future, an old scorched ghoul finds\u00a0a bizarre shack in the wasteland containing a bunch of vintage radio equipment and a trunk full of old books and tales of horror.. Tonight at sunset, he begins his broadcast of obscure horror stories and creepy tales from the past..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Pilot Episode 1 - The Radio:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.poster.avif?t=1755525394\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.webm?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.mp4?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gift, a vintage radio, given to him by his would-be adopted father. A radio of revelations bound only to him, repeatedly showing him all the people he brutally murdered on the night of September 20th, 1991..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>More About This Episode:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist (Robbie), seemingly wakes in a desert compound built by his adopted father. With no memory, rotting and no longer able to speak, he heads towards an old abandoned biker saloon with the sound of a bizarre radio broadcast playing in the distance.. As he finds more radios, things environmentally change as he is forced to remember what he has done and must realize he is no longer in the world of the living - Perhaps his own Hell..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Headset Recommended!:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game episode should be played with a headset or headphones for a more immersive game play experience with 3D sound - You might miss out on something!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Photo Sensitive Warning:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be advised that this game may contain flashing lights or effects that may be harmful to those who experience photo sensitivity or seizures induced by certain visual or video content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>The Game Series - Wasteland Horror Radio:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to WHR Sixty-Six Point, Uh.. Seven!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wasteland Horror Radio is a new episodic horror game series by HsRetroGames made with Unreal Engine. Each game is a new episode, a new creepy tale or story of horror..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.poster.avif?t=1755525394\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.webm?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/e8ccc622fb1dd2256a559b0750c8c425.mp4?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our near post apocalyptic future, an old scorched ghoul finds\u00a0a bizarre shack in the wasteland containing a bunch of vintage radio equipment and a trunk full of old books and tales of horror.. Tonight at sunset, he begins his broadcast of obscure horror stories and creepy tales from the past..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Pilot Episode 1 - The Radio:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.poster.avif?t=1755525394\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.webm?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3814590/extras/6d208e5f3b232a4251d7bf4c13268635.mp4?t=1755525394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gift, a vintage radio, given to him by his would-be adopted father. A radio of revelations bound only to him, repeatedly showing him all the people he brutally murdered on the night of September 20th, 1991..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>More About This Episode:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist (Robbie), seemingly wakes in a desert compound built by his adopted father. With no memory, rotting and no longer able to speak, he heads towards an old abandoned biker saloon with the sound of a bizarre radio broadcast playing in the distance.. As he finds more radios, things environmentally change as he is forced to remember what he has done and must realize he is no longer in the world of the living - Perhaps his own Hell..</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Headset Recommended!:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game episode should be played with a headset or headphones for a more immersive game play experience with 3D sound - You might miss out on something!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Photo Sensitive Warning:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be advised that this game may contain flashing lights or effects that may be harmful to those who experience photo sensitivity or seizures induced by certain visual or video content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
